+/// Property: the same well-formed script produces the same result (value, or
+/// error kind) under OptimizationLevel::None, Simple and Full.
+///
+/// Evidence: optimization is documented as semantics-preserving — the
+/// optimizer only folds constants, prunes dead code and eagerly calls pure
